---
source: tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Sanitize Git repositories for safe AI review (CLI, desktop GUI, and web UI)

Usage: Rustrepo-sanitizer [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  sanitize      Create a sanitized, reproducible review bundle from a Git repository
  list-formats  List supported archive and compression formats
  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version

Launch:
      --gui  Start the desktop GUI.
      --web  Start the web UI and HTTP API.

Web server:
      --web-bind <ADDR>            Web bind address, for example 127.0.0.1:8787.
      --web-token <TOKEN>          Require this bearer token for /api and the web UI login.
      --web-root <DIR>             Directory for web job workspaces and uploads.
      --web-local-roots <PATHS>    Colon-separated roots allowed for the server-local path input.
      --web-forgejo-base <URL>     Forgejo base URL for the repository selector.
      --web-forgejo-token <TOKEN>  Forgejo token used server-side for cloning and listing.
      --web-github-api <URL>       GitHub API base URL for the repository selector.
      --web-github-token <TOKEN>   GitHub token used server-side for cloning and listing.
